  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>sufentanil</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N01AH03</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Pokorná P et al. 2021</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>ventilated full-term neonates</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>sufentanil</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_sufentanil/Sufentanil_Pokorn2021_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>central volume of distribution (Vdc)</td><td>4.7</td><td>L/kg</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>clearance (CL)</td><td>0.651</td><td>L/h/kg</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr></table><h4>About sufentanil</h4><p>Sufentanil is a strong opioid used to treat pain, especially as an anesthetic adjunct and for postoperative pain relief. It remains in use, with an authorised product in the European Union, though it carries a boxed warning and is mainly used in controlled hospital settings such as anesthesia.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q417915\">Wikidata Q417915</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Sufentanil\">Sufentanil</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Pokorná P et al. (2021). Sufentanil Disposition and Pharmacokinetic Model-Based Dosage Regimen for Sufentanil in Ventilated Full-Term Neonates. <i>Pharmacology 106(7-8):384–389</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1159/000515787\">10.1159/000515787</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34077940\">34077940</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Pokorná_2021: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
